      {"gate": "G3", "layer": "invariant", "status": "active", "depends_on": [], "tests": ["C15-01", "C16-01"], "note": "D13.22 骨架已落地：config/scenes.json 与 settlement_units.json 的已定部分 ratified、未拍部分显式 UNRATIFIED 且拒绝偷渡，断言验的是结构契约不变量，故从 config_driven 改 invariant 并激活"}
